<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA MAINTAINS STEADY GAINS AT FIX.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA MAINTAINS STEADY GAINS AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
